# Icons: self-hosted SVG only

The public site makes no third-party requests for icons.

- Render icons through one shared SVG icon component from the stored icon value.
- Icon sets are dev dependencies served from your own origin and loaded only in admin pickers; never import whole icon-set JSON into public components.
- Uploaded icons are SVG-only and run through the same allowlist sanitizer on save (`laravel/uploads.mdc`); keep frontend and backend allowlists in sync.
- Never inject icon markup that skipped the allowlist.

## Don't

- Use icon web components that call a remote API, Font Awesome kits/CDN CSS, or icon web fonts on public pages.
- Import npm icon component packages into shared public components.
